{"riflemans2(ger)" "A single infantryman armed with a bolt-action K98 rifle and sandbags."}
{"flamers(ger)" "This team of specialists comes equipped with a flamethrower which strikes terror into the hearts of the enemy. It is one of the deadliest weapons in close range combat, capable of igniting buildings and setting cover ablaze -- invaluable when seeking to ferret out the enemy. However, the fuel canister each troop carries  on his back is highly volatile and could lead to sudden and certain death if hit by enemy fire. Use these specialists wisely, as you only have few available for each battle."}
{"riflemans2(usa)" "A single infantryman armed with a semi-automatic M1 Garand and sandbags."}
{"smgs2(usa)" "A single infantryman armed with a Thompson submachine gun and AT grenades."}
{"shotguns(usa)" "This team of soldiers is armed with M12 Shotguns and specializes in close combat. Their firepower is unmatched at close range and they can make short work of enemy infantry in close quarter combat."}
