{"snipers(usa)" "This well-trained marksman is armed with a scoped rifle and is capable of eliminating enemy infantry with precision, at long range. He relies on stealth to avoid detection while seeking to eliminate his targets. Use him to take out enemy officers or other important targets before engaging general infantry."}
