{"home_guards(eng)" "This squad is only lightly armed and minimally trained. With only bolt-action rifles and a few grenades, they are not equipped for serious combat. However, you may find them useful in defensive roles and for securing ground you've taken. Under the right conditions, and with proper support, they can be an effective fighting force worthy of the Commonwealth."}
