{"riflemans(ger)" "This squad is a balanced fighting force that combines rifles and other small arms, along with a light machine gun, to provide fire support. While they are equipped with the firepower necessary to advance upon the enemy, you may find that they are better served in a defensive role. The machine gun can suppress and splinter enemy infantry formations, while riflemen pick off their targets. This squad provides a solid backbone for any fighting force."}
